    "updated_at": "2023-08-18T08:48:55Z",
    "body": "This still hasn't been implemented for the general case, but custom variables for colors have been possible for a while now with the [palette feature](https://starship.rs/config/#prompt):\r\n```toml\r\npalette = 'foo'\r\n\r\n[palettes.foo]\r\ngit-bg = 'red'\r\ngit-fg = 'black'\r\n```",
